  "claim_scope": "GT-3 mini Natural Language Autoencoder preflight: reusable toy activation-batch, reconstruction, logit-diff, latent-preservation, brevity, and counterfactual contracts are kept for learner exercises, then a pinned TransformerLens gelu-1l checkpoint is loaded on CUDA. The report trains a small linear residual-to-phrase-id encoder and trainable phrase-id-to-residual decoder table on real final-token residuals, transmits only short discrete natural-language phrase ids, and validates held-out activation MSE against blank-text and prompt-label baselines, direction-probe logit-diff preservation, latent preservation, OOD long-context prompts, brevity, no-numeric-payload checks, shuffled-text controls, and counterfactual explanation changes. This is a live local phrase-bottleneck mini-NLA preflight, not Anthropic-scale NLA training or a claim of faithful natural-language explanation of arbitrary activations.",
